OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor calls TV report
OL,4,A'vote interference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform councillor has accused ITV of
OL,7,F"electoral interference" after
OL,8,Fundercover reporters joined its
OL,9,FPortsmouth council election campaign as
OL,10,Fpart of an undercover investigation
OL,11,Finto the party.
OL,13,FThe ITV News Exposure documentary
OL,14,FUndercover: A Year In Reform raised
OL,15,Fquestions about Reform's vetting
OL,16,Fprocedures for candidates following
OL,17,Fundercover filming.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
