OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor calls TV report
OL,4,A'vote interference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe party's Hampshire leader George
OL,7,FMadgwick was featured voicing support
OL,8,Ffor the Portsmouth Patriots
OL,9,Fanti-immigration group. He subsequently
OL,10,Fissued a statement saying the
OL,11,Fundercover reporters potentially had an
OL,12,F"impact on the result" of council
OL,13,Felections.
OL,15,FITV News has denied accusations of
OL,16,Felectoral interference. A spokesperson
OL,17,Fsaid the programme was produced in
OL,18,Faccordance with broadcasting
OL,19,Fregulations and was "in the public
OL,20,Finterest".
